    <p class="pb-3 font-bold">AI/ML Engineer</p>
    <p class="pb-6">
        <a href="mailto:david@fekke.com">david@fekke.com</a> | Jacksonville, FL | <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/davidfekke">linkedin.com/in/davidfekke</a> | <a href="https://github.com/davidfekke">github.com/davidfekke</a> 
