    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold pb-2">Technical Skills</h3>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 pb-6 space-y-1">
        <li><strong>Languages:</strong> Python, C, C# .NET, Obj-C, Swift, SwiftUI, Java, Kotlin, Apex, TypeScript, JavaScript, SQL</li>
        <li><strong>Tools/Libraries:</strong> TensorFlow, Keras, PyTorch, Scikit-learn, NumPy, Pandas, Matplotlib, Seaborn, Hugging Face, SQLite, Node.js</li>
        <li><strong>Databases:</strong> Microsoft SQL Server, Postgres, Azure SQL, MySQL</li>
