            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
                <li>Created a traditional machine learning model for predicting exam scores of students.</li>
                <li>Used an EDA process to find the best labels and features for predicting the target value.</li>
                <li>Built a scaler and regression model with a classification model using Scikit-learn.</li>
            </ul>
        </FloatRight>
    </div>

